## Xcode User Settings
# Ignore individual user data, but keep shared team data
xcuserdata/
xcdebugger/
ThirdParty/

## Shared Data Exceptions
# Ensure shared schemes and team settings ARE tracked
!xcshareddata/
!xcschemes/

## Build Artifacts and Derived Data
# Ignore local build results and cache
DerivedData/
build/
Docs/AppleDocsIndex/Generated/
SwiftTagAppleScriptTests/*.scpt
SwiftTagTestFiles/*.swifttag

## Other Xcode Metadata
# Ignore temporary and state files
*.moved-aside
*.xcuserstate
*.xccheckout
*.xcscmblueprint

## vi/vim
*.swp

## Codex
# Ignore Codex generated files
.codex/

## VSCode
# Ignore VSCode workspace settings
.vscode/

## Jekyll
# Ignore Jekyll build artifacts and cache
_site/
.sass-cache/
.jekyll-cache/
.jekyll-metadata
vendor/bundle/
.bundle/